# webview_go asks pkg-config for webkit2gtk-4.0 (Ubuntu 22.04). Ubuntu 24.04
# only has webkit2gtk-4.1 (the same API on libsoup 3), so the 24.04 build puts
# this folder first on PKG_CONFIG_PATH and links against 4.1. webview.h itself
# handles both versions.
Name: webkit2gtk-4.0 (-> 4.1)
Description: Boop build shim: webkit2gtk-4.1 under the 4.0 name
Version: 2.0
Requires: webkit2gtk-4.1
